wcTools 10.0.500.3 - Wildcat! Sysop Tools
Command-line tools for Wildcat! sysops,
in Python on the wcPAPI SDK. Trace SMTP
mail end to end through the logs, audit
smtpfilter rules, list mail, files, areas,
groups and user access, replay spool
messages, manage IP access.
Needs wcsrv2.dll 10.0.500.3+, Python 3.6+
wcPAPI included. (c) 1998-2026 Santronics
Software Inc. github.com/WinserverSupport
